// @description Lucky Spectral Leprechaun
// @version 5.2.2
// @author JSchwartz
// @changelog Harden Lucky Slot serialization and clarify project persistence.
// @about Drawable spectral filtering, a route-aware spectral gate, FFT damage,
//   and stereo delays wrapped in
//   a rainbow-leprechaun interface. Draw two curves, morph between them, and
//   drag FILTER/GATE to choose the spectral signal flow. SAFE RND protects
//   gain-sensitive controls; the ? button explains every custom control.
// @link https://github.com/janschwartzmusic/lucky-spectral-filter
desc:Lucky Spectral Leprechaun
//tags: FFT filter spectral gate routing stereo delay drawable modulation
//author: JSchwartz

slider1:30<10,1000,1>-Filter: Low Cut (Hz)
slider2:18000<1000,24000,10>-Filter: High Cut (Hz)
slider3:1<0.1,4,0.1>-Filter: Edge Width (octaves)
slider4:0<-12,12,0.1>-Filter: Spectral Tilt (dB/octave)
slider5:0<-24,12,0.1>-Filter: Output (dB)
slider6:1<0,5,1{1024,2048,4096,8192,16384,32768}>-Filter: FFT Size
slider7:0<0,100,1>-Damage: Transient Smear (%)
slider8:0<0,100,1>-Damage: Spectral Grain (%)
slider9:0<0,100,1>-Damage: Phase Scatter (%)
slider10:0<0,4,1>-Damage: Frame Repeat (frames)
slider11:0<0,100,0.1>-Drawing: Morph A to B (%)
slider12:0<-4,4,0.01>-Drawing: Shift (octaves)
slider13:0<0,4,0.01>-Drawing: Auto Sweep Depth (octaves)
slider14:0.2<0,10,0.01>-Drawing: Auto Sweep Rate (Hz)
slider15:220<1,2000,1>-Pre Delay: Left Time (ms)
slider16:330<1,2000,1>-Pre Delay: Right Time (ms)
slider17:35<0,95,0.1>-Pre Delay: Feedback (%)
slider18:50<0,100,0.1>-Pre Delay: Crossfeed / Ping-Pong (%)
slider19:20<0,100,0.1>-Pre Delay: HF Damping (%)
slider20:0<0,100,0.1>-Pre Delay: Mix (%)
slider21:375<1,2000,1>-Post Delay: Left Time (ms)
slider22:500<1,2000,1>-Post Delay: Right Time (ms)
slider23:40<0,95,0.1>-Post Delay: Feedback (%)
slider24:70<0,100,0.1>-Post Delay: Crossfeed / Ping-Pong (%)
slider25:25<0,100,0.1>-Post Delay: HF Damping (%)
slider26:0<0,100,0.1>-Post Delay: Mix (%)
slider27:0<0,100,0.1>-Pre Spectral: Saturation to Crush (%)
slider28:0<0,100,0.1>-Pre Delay: Diffusion (%)
slider29:0<0,100,0.1>-Post Delay: Diffusion (%)
slider30:0<0,100,0.1>-Pre Spectral: Distortion Spread (%)
slider31:6<0,60,0.1>-Distortion: Low Drive (dB)
slider32:12<0,60,0.1>-Distortion: Mid Drive (dB)
slider33:6<0,60,0.1>-Distortion: High Drive (dB)
slider34:0<0,33,1>-LFO 1: Target
slider35:0<0,5,1>-LFO 1: Shape
slider36:0.5<0.05,20,0.01>-LFO 1: Rate (Hz)
slider37:0<0,100,0.1>-LFO 1: Depth (%)
slider38:0<0,33,1>-LFO 2: Target
slider39:1<0,5,1>-LFO 2: Shape
slider40:0.33<0.05,20,0.01>-LFO 2: Rate (Hz)
slider41:0<0,100,0.1>-LFO 2: Depth (%)
slider42:0<0,33,1>-LFO 3: Target
slider43:2<0,5,1>-LFO 3: Shape
slider44:0.2<0.05,20,0.01>-LFO 3: Rate (Hz)
slider45:0<0,100,0.1>-LFO 3: Depth (%)
slider46:0<0,33,1>-LFO 4: Target
slider47:5<0,5,1>-LFO 4: Shape
slider48:0.125<0.05,20,0.01>-LFO 4: Rate (Hz)
slider49:0<0,100,0.1>-LFO 4: Depth (%)
slider50:0<0,12,1{Free,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/8T,1/8,1/4T,1/4,1/2T,1/2,1 bar,2 bars,4 bars}>-Drawing: Auto Sweep Sync
slider51:0<0,1,1{Unlinked,Linked}>-Pre Delay: Link Left and Right
slider52:0<0,12,1{Free,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/8T,1/8,1/4T,1/4,1/2T,1/2,1 bar,2 bars,4 bars}>-Pre Delay: Left Sync
slider53:0<0,12,1{Free,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/8T,1/8,1/4T,1/4,1/2T,1/2,1 bar,2 bars,4 bars}>-Pre Delay: Right Sync
slider54:0<0,1,1{Unlinked,Linked}>-Post Delay: Link Left and Right
slider55:0<0,12,1{Free,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/8T,1/8,1/4T,1/4,1/2T,1/2,1 bar,2 bars,4 bars}>-Post Delay: Left Sync
slider56:0<0,12,1{Free,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/8T,1/8,1/4T,1/4,1/2T,1/2,1 bar,2 bars,4 bars}>-Post Delay: Right Sync
slider57:0<0,12,1{Free,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/8T,1/8,1/4T,1/4,1/2T,1/2,1 bar,2 bars,4 bars}>-LFO 1: Tempo Sync
slider58:0<0,12,1{Free,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/8T,1/8,1/4T,1/4,1/2T,1/2,1 bar,2 bars,4 bars}>-LFO 2: Tempo Sync
slider59:0<0,12,1{Free,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/8T,1/8,1/4T,1/4,1/2T,1/2,1 bar,2 bars,4 bars}>-LFO 3: Tempo Sync
slider60:0<0,12,1{Free,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/8T,1/8,1/4T,1/4,1/2T,1/2,1 bar,2 bars,4 bars}>-LFO 4: Tempo Sync
slider61:100<0,100,0.1>-Character Cauldron: Mix (%)
slider62:0<0,6,1{Free,Sine,Triangle,Rectangle,Saw Up,Saw Down,Random Steps}>-Drawing: Curve A Shape
slider63:0<0,6,1{Free,Sine,Triangle,Rectangle,Saw Up,Saw Down,Random Steps}>-Drawing: Curve B Shape
slider64:0<0,100,0.1>-Spectral Gate: Mix (%)
slider65:-48<-96,0,0.1>-Spectral Gate: Threshold (dBFS)
slider66:60<0,96,0.1>-Spectral Gate: Range (dB)
slider67:10<0.5,500,0.1>-Spectral Gate: Attack (ms)
slider68:180<5,5000,1>-Spectral Gate: Release (ms)
slider69:6<0,24,0.1>-Spectral Gate: Knee (dB)
slider70:20<20,1000,1>-Spectral Gate: Low Cut (Hz)
slider71:20000<1000,20000,10>-Spectral Gate: High Cut (Hz)
slider72:1<0.1,4,0.1>-Spectral Gate: Edge Width (octaves)
slider73:0<-12,12,0.1>-Spectral Gate: Detector Tilt (dB/octave)
slider74:100<0,100,0.1>-Spectral Gate: Stereo Link (%)
slider75:25<0,100,0.1>-Spectral Gate: Frequency Smooth (%)
slider76:100<0,100,0.1>-Spectral Gate: Drawing Contour (%)
